FeaXDrive2 model source release

This code is derived from the FeaXDrive/NAVSIM research implementation and retains
its Apache-2.0 license. Shared Action Flow-DiT components derive from ReCogDrive
and NAVSIM; original module names in state dictionaries are preserved.
ReCogDrive: Copyright 2025 Xiaomi Corporation, Apache-2.0.
LightningDiT: Copyright (c) 2024 HUST Vision Lab, MIT License.
Copies of the upstream notices/licenses are included in licenses/.

Changes for this source release include Flow-only extraction, local import
reorganization, portable model/checkpoint interfaces, and training examples.
The spatial grounding and safety objectives are FeaXDrive2 additions.

Alpamayo 1.5 is an external dependency from NVIDIA. Its implementation and model
weights retain their separate upstream licenses. They are not redistributed here.
NAVSIM, nuPlan, datasets, maps and checkpoints are not bundled or relicensed.
